# REQUIRES: aie-registered-target
## Regression test: when a remark RUN line precedes another RUN line, the
## chained --update-llc-checks must keep it in place rather than moving it
## past the following RUN line.

# RUN: cp -f %S/Inputs/aie-ore-remark-first.ll %t.ll && %update_ore_test_checks --update-llc-checks %t.ll
# RUN: diff -u %S/Inputs/aie-ore-remark-first.ll.expected %t.ll

## Verify idempotency via UTC_ARGS (no --update-llc-checks on the command line):
# RUN: %update_ore_test_checks %t.ll
# RUN: diff -u %S/Inputs/aie-ore-remark-first.ll.expected %t.ll
